 id="realDownloadUrl">If your download doesn't start automatically please <a href="https://exfont.com/downfile?post_id=347&post_slug=legothick&bf_nonce=9d00ab65c9">click here</a>.</span></div> <script>jQuery(document).ready(function ($) {
                        function endCountdown() {
                            document.getElementById("realDownloadUrl").getElementsByTagName("a")[0].click();
                        }

                        function handleTimer() {
                            if (count === 0) {
                                $('#count_num').html(count);

